{"kind": "question", "qid": "2023.acl-long.386#3", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "Subtask", "answer": "The semantic error type with the lowest total percentages in the HOVER dataset is the **Subtask** error.\n\nAccording to Table 2 (\"Reasoning program evaluation for incorrectly-predicted examples from each hop length in HOVER\"), the Semantic error breakdown by type is:\n- **Token**: 8% (2-hop), 20% (3-hop), 18% (4-hop)\n- **Structure**: 19% (2-hop), 13% (3-hop), 57% (4-hop)\n- **Subtask**: 2% (2-hop), 5% (3-hop), 2% (4-hop)\n\nThe Subtask error type has the lowest percentages across all hop lengths (2%, 5%, and 2%), compared to Token (8%, 20%, 18%) and Structure (19%, 13%, 57%).", "citations": [{"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 7, "bbox": {"x0": 0.165, "y0": 0.368, "x1": 0.48, "y1": 0.576}}], "ranked": ["2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p020", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p016"], "pool": ["2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p005", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p016", "2023.acl-long.386/p020", "2023.acl-long.386/p008", "watch_d/p001", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p011", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p013", "2023.acl-long.386/p013"], "ndcg_at_k": 0.6309, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 2, "calls": 7, "tokens": 44613, "stop_reason": "", "latency_s": 20.331}
{"kind": "question", "qid": "2023.acl-long.386#4", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "56.8", "answer": "To answer, I first identify which dataset has the highest ProgramFC retrieval recall@10, then read the corresponding InstructGPT + Self-Ask closed-book macro-F1.\n\n1) Highest ProgramFC retrieval recall@10: Figure 5 (\"Retrieval recall@10 for the one-step retrieval and the iterative retrieval in PROGRAMFC\") shows ProgramFC recall@10 values of 77.13 (HOVER 2-hop), 59.17 (HOVER 3-hop), 43.88 (HOVER 4-hop), and **82.65 (FEVEROUS-S)**. 82.65 is the highest among these, so the dataset with the highest ProgramFC retrieval recall@10 is FEVEROUS-S (2023.acl-long.386/p006, Figure 5).\n\n2) InstructGPT with Self-Ask in the closed-book setting on FEVEROUS-S: Table 3 (\"Closed-book setting: macro-F1 scores for PROGRAMFC and for the baselines\") lists the InstructGPT variants on the FEVEROUS column: Direct = 60.13, ZS-CoT = 54.78, CoT = 61.05, **Self-Ask = 56.82** (2023.acl-long.386/p007, Table 3). The same page's text states the four InstructGPT prompts are \"(i) direct prompting..., (ii) CoT..., (iii) ZS-CoT..., and (iv) Self-Ask (Press et al., 2022), which is a variant of CoT that guides the model reasoning by asking a series of questions\" (2023.acl-long.386/p007). The closed-book FEVEROUS self-ask value is therefore 56.82, which is 56.8 to 1 decimal.\n\nAnswer: **56.8**", "citations": [{"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 6, "bbox": null}, {"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 7, "bbox": null}], "ranked": ["2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p001", "2023.acl-long.386/p003"], "pool": ["2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p005", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p011", "2023.acl-long.386/p002", "2023.acl-long.386/p008", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p003", "2023.acl-long.386/p001"], "ndcg_at_k": 1.0, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 2, "calls": 5, "tokens": 32596, "stop_reason": "", "latency_s": 13.157}
